      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">Automotive Data Intelligence. <span class="text-gradient">Free for Consumers.</span></h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-silver-400 leading-relaxed">Car Alpha is a vehicle intelligence platform built to give every car owner, buyer, and seller access to the same data that professionals use &mdash; without cost, without accounts, without friction.</p>
